    "---\n",
    "## 2. Efficiency frontiers\n",
    "\n",
    "A configuration lies on the **Pareto (efficiency) frontier** if no other configuration in the\n",
    "comparison set is simultaneously *better on skill* and *cheaper on energy*. These are the\n",
    "\"you'd have to sacrifice something to do better\" configurations — the practical candidates\n",
    "worth considering when scientific performance and computational cost both matter.\n",
    "\n",
    "`pareto_frontier` returns a boolean mask; `plot_efficiency_frontier` overlays the frontier\n",
    "on the skill–energy scatter and connects the frontier points to make the trade-off curve visible."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 10,
   "id": "854365ce",
